00:36:39.510 --> 00:36:43.910
I want my users to use
password-- email and password.

00:36:43.910 --> 00:36:47.350
And I was like, oh,
you should not do that.

00:36:47.350 --> 00:36:51.220
The best way to manage
passwords is not managing them.

00:36:51.220 --> 00:36:55.352
So Firebase, it
provides authentication

00:36:55.352 --> 00:36:57.310
with a bunch of different
methods like Twitter,

00:36:57.310 --> 00:36:59.060
and Facebook, and
