00:41:35.200 --> 00:41:36.033
SARA ROBINSON: Yeah.

00:41:36.033 --> 00:41:38.720
There's actually a fairly new
library called Firebase UI that

00:41:38.720 --> 00:41:42.470
helps you bind your Firebase
data to a table view in iOS,

00:41:42.470 --> 00:41:43.920
or a list view in Android.

00:41:43.920 --> 00:41:46.170
So it makes it really easy
to just listen for changes.

00:41:46.170 --> 00:41:48.310
Whenever that data is
changed in Firebase,

00:41:48.310 --> 00:41:49.934
add the new item
to the list view.

00:41:49.934 --> 00:41:50.850
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Cool.

00:41:50.850 --> 00:41:54.934
